| #   | Cut                                                                    |              Saves | Cost of cutting                                                |
| --- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- | -----------------: | -------------------------------------------------------------- |
| 1   | 6.4 Responsive polish                                                  |               ~2 h | Mobile experience is rougher; most reviewers use desktop       |
